.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース Marimekko\nストッキング l'atelier du savon\n靴 Dr.Martens(used)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/09/23/5427921/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤリング Clarie's"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生の時に買ったもの笑\n普通のピンクだったのを\n油性のペンでわざと汚したよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/09/23/5427921/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス\nKAREN WALKER RUNAWAY\nスカート ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/09/23/5427921/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飴色のバレッタと秋色のトップス\nレトロ真っしぐら〜\nこの格好で喫茶店行きたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋2日間来てくださった方も\nたくさんいたよー！\nお疲れ様でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜の乃木どこ、\n絵がんばりました！\n改めて絵を描くことが\n好きだと感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと自分らしい\n絵を極めていきたい。\nまたブログにも絵載せていくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂美術部とかあったら\n部員でひとつの作品作ってみたい。\n楽しそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/09/23/5427921/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお茶会とカルタ会だよっ\n楽しんでるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-14792":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/25/0806194/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"samurai 